hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1715","Narrated to us ʿAlī ibn Ḥujr, narrated to us ʿAlī ibn Mus-hir, on the authority of al-Mukhtār ibn Fulful, from Anas ibn Mālik (RA), who said:\n“One day, the Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) led us in prayer. When he gave the salām, he turned his face toward us.”\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
